  "title": "Exclusive: FIDC to represent NBFCs' case to IRDAI for gradual reset of insurance commissions",
  "summary": "Non-bank lenders are seeking a phased reduction in insurance distribution commissions proposed by IRDAI, arguing that the sharp reduction could make credit-linked insurance distribution unviable and disrupt the network through which insurance reaches customers. Five industry sources told ET BFSI that the SRO body FIDC is aggregating feedback from NBFCs and will submit its representation to IRDAI by October 24.",
